{"id": 1315, "slug": "cyprus", "main": "<div class=\"hero phero dhero\">\n  <img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-unnamed-15-2000.webp\" alt=\"Cyprus green coast trail | Cigala Cycling Tours\">\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Home</a> / <a href=\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/destinations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Destinations</a> / Cyprus</div>\n    <h2 class=\"pill-eyebrow hero-sub\">The Undiscovered Cyclist’s Island</h2>\n    <h1>Cycling in Cyprus</h1>\n    <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ctas\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"#tours\">Upcoming tours →</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/trips/private-trips/\">Custom tours</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<section style=\"padding-top:44px\">\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    \n    <div class=\"dsplit\"><div><div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Cyprus</div><h2>A PARADISE FOR CYCLING, ESPECIALLY GRAVEL</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div><div class=\"prose dprose\"><p>Cyprus is a hidden gem for cyclists, offering year-round sunshine, smooth roads, challenging mountain climbs, scenic coastal rides, and gravel paths that make it a paradise for off-road enthusiasts. Our guided Cyprus cycling tours combine performance training with breathtaking landscapes, warm hospitality, and Mediterranean culture.</p></div></div><div class=\"cmapbox\"><svg class=\"cmap\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 640\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Map of Cyprus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"640\" fill=\"#0a0c0e\"/><path d=\"M2116.7,-1417.6L2131.1,-1412.5L2159.0,-1405.4L2176.5,-1397.0L2186.1,-1394.6L2208.4,-1412.0L2242.7,-1411.5L2272.2,-1409.2L2287.4,-1406.4L2305.7,-1400.7L2328.9,-1396.5L2337.6,-1404.9L2351.2,-1428.9L2356.0,-1432.2L2360.0,-1434.6L2376.7,-1436.4L2392.7,-1434.6L2399.9,-1430.3L2407.0,-1411.1L2426.2,-1