sea. - Cigala Cycling Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Good to know</div><h2>CYPRUS FACTS</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"facts4\"><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.3-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.7-6 10-6 10z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2.2\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Location</h3><p>Cyprus is the jewel of the Eastern Mediterranean, with routes stretching from the turquoise coastlines around Paphos and Limassol to the rugged Troodos Mountains at the island’s heart. The variety makes it ideal for both endurance training and relaxed cycling escapes.</p></div></div><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2.5v2.5M12 19v2.5M2.5 12H5M19 12h2.5M5.3 5.3l1.8 1.8M16.9 16.9l1.8 1.8M5.3 18.7l1.8-1.8M16.9 7.1l1.8-1.8\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Climate</h3><p>Cyprus boasts more than 320 days of sunshine a year, making it one of the best year-round cycling destinations in Europe. Winters are mild and perfect for training camps, while spring and autumn bring warm, dry weather and vibrant landscapes.</p></div></div><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 3h8l-.5 6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-7 0L8 3zM12 12.5V20M8.5 20.5h7\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Cuisine</h3><p>The island’s cuisine blends Mediterranean freshness with Middle Eastern influences. Expect grilled meats, fresh fish, halloumi cheese, olives, seasonal vegetables, and local wines. Traditional meze meals are the perfect way to recover after a long ride.</p></div></div><div class=\"panel fact\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.5 19.5 9 8l4 6.5 2.5-3.5 6 8.5z\"/></svg></div><div><h3>Terrain</h3><p>Cycling terrain in Cyprus is diverse. Long coastal stretches give way to rolling hills, while the Troodos Mountains offer sustained climbs with gradients to rival classic European routes. Smooth tarmac and light traffic outside main towns make it a dream for road cyclists.</p></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"cc cc-page\"><section id=\"tours\" class=\"dtours\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">2027 season</div><h2>UPCOMING CYPRUS TRIPS</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div><p class=lede>Discover our upcoming Cyprus cycling tours and experience spectacular mountain roads, quiet coastal routes and unforgettable Mediterranean riding.</p></div></div><div class=\"tours\"><a class=\"tour\" data-k=\"gravel\" data-country=\"cyprus\" data-month=\"4\" data-level=\"expert\" href=\"/trips/cyprus-crossing-gravel/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-cyprus-crossing-gravel.webp\" alt=\"Cyprus Crossing bike tour\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tag gravel\">Gravel</span><img class=\"flag\" src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-cy.webp\" alt=\"Flag of Cyprus\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\"><div class=\"tx\"><time class=\"when\" datetime=\"2027-04-22\">22–29 Apr 2027</time><h3>Cyprus Crossing</h3><p>A lifetime trip in one of the most beautiful islands in Europe.</p><span class=\"facts\"><span>Cyprus</span><span>415 km</span><span>8,700 m climbing</span></span><span class=\"go\">View tour →</span></div></a></div></div></section></div>\n<section>\n  <div class=\"in\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Custom tours</div><h2>MOST POPULAR CYPRUS CUSTOM TOURS</h2><div class=\"bar\"></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"prose dprose\"><p>Every custom tour is unique. Explore our most popular Cyprus itineraries and let us tailor them to your group, dates and riding goals.</p></div><div class=\"fchips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter by tour type\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fchip on\" data-f=\"all\"><span class=\"fd\"></span>All</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fchip\" data-f=\"road\"><span class=\"fd\"></span>Road</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fchip\" data-f=\"gravel\"><span class=\"fd\"></span>Gravel</button></div><div class=\"tgrid\"><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"road\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-01077150-900.webp\" alt=\"Gravel Bike Tours\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">Road</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>Cyprus Mountain &amp; Coast</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Ride from the Mediterranean coast into the spectacular Troodos Mountains, combining challenging climbs, quiet roads and stunning island scenery.</p></div><div class=\"ctas one\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\">Enquire this tour →</a></div></div></article><article class=\"tcard dtour\" data-k=\"gravel\"><a class=\"ph\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\"><img src=\"https://staging.tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-01098332-900.webp\" alt=\"Cycling in the Trodos Mountains Cyprus\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag gravel\">Gravel</span></span></a><div class=\"tx\"><h2>Troodos Gravel Escape</h2><div class=\"desc\"><p>Explore the wild side of Cyprus on gravel roads through pine forests, mountain villages and remote trails in the heart of the Troodos Mountains.</p></div><div class=\"ctas one\"><a class=\"btn btn-go\" href=\"/trips/private-trips/\">Enquire this tour →</a></div></div></article></div><div class=\"dband\"><div class=\"band\">\n      <img src=\"img/dest-private-custom-tours.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"tx\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Custom tours</div>\n        <h2>Can't find the perfect one?</h2>\n        <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Build you